WEBVTT

00:00:00.116 --> 00:00:05.767
Setting up departments

00:00:05.817 --> 00:00:14.155
Open HR and Staff, then Departments. Departments group your staff, such as Science or Administration.

00:00:17.173 --> 00:00:19.207
Press Add Department.

00:00:21.183 --> 00:00:25.457
Type the department name, and a short description if you like.

00:00:35.869 --> 00:00:41.343
Press Add Department again to save. The new department appears in the list.

00:00:44.562 --> 00:00:49.247
Department added
